# viewcrossmon and tagcrossmon by monitor name; view,<tag>,1 changes every monitor's view.
monitors 2
config new_is_master=0
open a
open b
dispatch viewcrossmon,2,HEADLESS-2
check
open c
dispatch tagcrossmon,3,HEADLESS-1
check
dispatch tagcrossmon,4,HEADLESS-1
check
dispatch view,5,1
check
dispatch view,1,1
check
